cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GrantThai, please cite it as below. GrantThai is a joint work
  with ศูนย์ความรู้พลเมืองปัญญาประดิษฐ์, a centre of ARAYA NIKAH SOCIAL
  ENTERPRISE CO. (อารยานิกะห์ วิสาหกิจเพื่อสังคม). Code is licensed
  Apache-2.0; documentation, specifications and data are licensed CC BY 4.0
  (see REUSE.toml). The author entry below names the founder only, per
  GrantThai's authorship policy (see GOVERNANCE.md).
title: "GrantThai"
abstract: >
  GrantThai is open, unofficial research infrastructure that helps a person
  turn a real problem into one research project object, checked against
  GrantThai's own rules (planned for v0.1), then render it to a single
  copy/paste-ready draft file (build/NRIIS_SUBMISSION.md). It is not
  affiliated with NRCT, TSRI, any PMU, or NRIIS. Phase 0 scaffold; not yet
  released.
authors:
